    "long_instructions": "**Teacher note**: The following are student-facing directions from Lesson 3: AI-Assisted Creation. You do not need to complete the tasks, but it may be useful to peruse this canvas to prepare for guiding your students through it. Try adding text, shapes, highlighting, etc. \r\n___\r\n\r\n## Generate and Judge Project\r\n\r\nYou will use this canvas to create your project throughout the unit. Any work that you add will be saved and available in future lessons.\r\n\r\n1. Type in your Theme and Audience into the provided boxes.\r\n\r\n2. Think of **at least three** purposes that your audience might use an AI for.\r\n\r\n3. Type your Purpose ideas in the provided box.\r\n",
